            Behind <span>every statistic <br /> pulses</span> a human story
          </h2>
          <p>
            We believe that every space tells a story. Founded in 2010 by visionary <br />designer, our journey began
            with a simple yet powerful mission: <br /> to transform ordinary spaces into extraordinary experiences.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="counter-top-img slide-anim" data-delay="0.3" data-offset="100" data-direction="right">
